          "filename": "The American Adventure, Epcot (6068014761).jpg",
          "caption": "Epcot (Experimental Planned Community of Tomorrow) is the second theme park to open at Walt Disney World, focusing on future technology and world cultures. The back half of Epcot is World Showcase, which deals with cultures of eleven different nations.\n\nThis is the \"host\" pavilion for the other ten national pavilions. This Revolutionary War era band is playing a number of patriotic tunes, and by the time it ends with \"God Bless America,\" the visitors are expected to sing along. The pavilion also hosts a theater where some stories are told from throughout the history of the United States.",
